WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.153
Cat woke up.

2
00:00:11.154 --> 00:00:16.333
Tom was still at the moat.

3
00:00:16.334 --> 00:00:27.491
"Hmm . . . ," Cat thought.

4
00:00:27.492 --> 00:00:32.856
Splash! The crocodile dropped into the water.

5
00:00:32.857 --> 00:00:38.835
Tom watched it swim away with the crown.

6
00:00:38.836 --> 00:00:42.309
"Ha-ha!" Dirk laughed softly.

7
00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:47.171
"You're going to get thrown in the Grim Dungeon!"

8
00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:49.831
"Oh no!" Tom thought.

9
00:00:49.832 --> 00:00:55.401
"Not the Grim Dungeon!"

10
00:00:55.402 --> 00:01:04.891
The princess was still wailing. "My crown!"

11
00:01:04.892 --> 00:01:12.670
"Psst! Tom!" whispered a voice. "Over here!"

12
00:01:12.671 --> 00:01:16.247
Tom looked around.

13
00:01:16.248 --> 00:01:19.569
Cat was hiding near the palace!

14
00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:32.896
She waved to Tom. "Come here."

15
00:01:32.897 --> 00:01:41.795
"Now, now." Dirk patted the princess' shoulder.

16
00:01:41.796 --> 00:01:46.755
"We can get you a new royal crown."

17
00:01:46.756 --> 00:01:51.685
The princess sobbed.

18
00:01:51.686 --> 00:01:56.548
"But that one is very special."

19
00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:59.909
Tom hurried toward Cat.

20
00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:02.978
Then he blinked in surprise.

21
00:02:02.979 --> 00:02:08.146
Cat had the fishing rod and . . . the crown!

22
00:02:08.147 --> 00:02:10.923
"Wow!" said Tom.

23
00:02:10.924 --> 00:02:13.892
"How did you get the crown?"

24
00:02:13.893 --> 00:02:16.180
Cat shrugged.

25
00:02:16.181 --> 00:02:19.173
"I woke up and decided to go fishing.

26
00:02:19.174 --> 00:02:21.526
But I caught this instead."

27
00:02:21.527 --> 00:02:26.403
Tom hid the crown in his robe.

28
00:02:26.404 --> 00:02:29.194
He ran back to the moat.

29
00:02:29.195 --> 00:02:34.589
"Wait! Princess Mary!" Tom called.

30
00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:47.868
He waved his wand. Poof!

31
00:02:47.869 --> 00:02:51.780
"My royal crown!" the princess cried.

32
00:02:51.781 --> 00:02:55.143
"Oh, Tom," she said happily.

33
00:02:55.144 --> 00:03:00.134
"You're the best royal wizard ever!"

34
00:03:00.135 --> 00:03:04.538
Tom bowed. "Thank you, Princess."

35
00:03:04.539 --> 00:03:07.332
He put the crown back on her head.

36
00:03:07.333 --> 00:03:18.263
Everyone clapped—but Dirk.

